WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.408
At a fundraiser, the room goes quiet.

00:00:02.811 --> 00:00:04.638
Someone steps up to tell their story.

00:00:05.036 --> 00:00:07.756
What has to happen backstage
for that moment to land?

00:00:08.154 --> 00:00:11.822
Through Cause on Cue, we work
with your nonprofit on the program,

00:00:12.165 --> 00:00:14.363
volunteers and sponsor opportunities.

00:00:14.762 --> 00:00:17.811
Your organization leads
the fundraising relationships.

00:00:18.209 --> 00:00:23.498
We coordinate catering, décor,
multimedia, staffing and logistics.

00:00:23.896 --> 00:00:25.764
If a sponsor wants an activation,

00:00:26.053 --> 00:00:29.267
we design it around your mission
and the benefits you've approved.

00:00:29.665 --> 00:00:32.413
We produce more than two hundred
and fifty small

00:00:32.426 --> 00:00:35.943
and midsize events each year,
in addition to our corporate work.

00:00:36.341 --> 00:00:39.157
The right support starts
with the team you already have.

00:00:39.556 --> 00:00:45.050
For approved nonprofit partnerships,
VNV-Q is included at no additional cost.

00:00:45.448 --> 00:00:49.858
Coordinate guests, volunteers,
sponsor activity and reporting,

00:00:50.242 --> 00:00:52.454
then keep using the tools between events.

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:56.643
Tell us about your mission, your event
and the people already involved.

00:00:57.042 --> 00:01:00.531
Explore a nonprofit partnership
with VNV Events.
